            "title": "Question: JSON properties",
            "id": 103099,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa saja properti dari objek JSON ini yang dikirim sebagai respons oleh server?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;student&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mae Wong&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;grade&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"student\"</code> dan <code>\"grade\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Mae Wong\"</code>, <code>\"A\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"student\": \"Mae Wong\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"student\"</code> dan <code>\"grade\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
